      "content": "that's perfect, \"uninterrupted continuation\" sounds really strong. \n\nthanks for the help. one more thing though... since they'll probably try to ignore me or claim my documents are fake, i need to think about the next steps for actual diplomatic presence. if they refuse to acknowledge the letter, i know i'll have to seek recognition from smaller neutral nations or maybe even non-governmental international bodies to build pressure. \n\ncan you help me look into which international organizations or specific small nations might be more open to discussing sovereign claims from unrecognized former principalities? i want to be prepared if the Luxembourg response is a dead end.",
